      "message": "refactor(app): remove the unused tool-body view helpers\n\nSince #837 the simulation draws the tool through sim_tool_body, so\ntool_body_view::assembly_for_operation had no callers and bare_assembly\nwas reached only from it and from its own test. Remove both, the test\nthat exercised bare_assembly, and the ToolKind import they alone used.\nNo behaviour change.\n\nFixes #857\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
